---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
import Banner from "../components/elements/Banner.astro";
import { Image } from "astro:assets";
import daySetup from "../assets/photos/molly_beaton/daySetup.jpg";
---

<Layout title="About - A Friendly Wave">
  <main
    class="grid gap-y-16 pt-24 pb-48"
    style="grid-template-columns: 1fr min(64rem, calc(100% - 3rem)) 1fr;"
  >
    <Banner />

    <p>
      A Friendly Wave is a volunteer-run music space and radio initiative based
      on Salt Spring Island, BC. In collaboration with the <a
        href="https://www.cassettecafebar.com/"
        target="_blank"
        rel="noopener noreferrer">Cassette Cafe</a
      >, we host listening sessions, parties, and talks centered around music
      appreciation.<br /><br />Our custom HiFi setup was built by local
      craftspersons to audiophile specification. The space is decorated and
      enhanced by local artists and designers. The events are presented by local
      musicians and DJs, though we occasionally import DJ talent for parties.<br
      /><br />Currently we aim for a weekend of live programming every three-ish
      months. Otherwise our radio collaboration with CHIR FM and our Mixcloud
      uploads are ongoing.<br /><br />Join us for this unique cultural
      experiment that celebrates Salt Spring Island's creative spirit while
      introducing new perspectives on how we experience music together. Whether
      you're an audiophile, a casual listener, or simply curious about mindful
      cultural experiences, we hope <span class="text-link-hover"
        >A Friendly Wave</span
      > offers something welcoming and transformative.
    </p>
    <figure style="grid-column: 1 / -1;">
      <Image
        src={daySetup}
        alt="Day setup at A Friendly Wave listening space"
        class="w-full object-cover"
      />
      <figcaption class="text-text/50 mt-2 pr-4 text-right text-sm">
        Photo: Molly Beaton
      </figcaption>
    </figure>
    <h2 class="text-center text-2xl">Four Unique Listening Experiences</h2>

    <div class="grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2">
      <div class="border-text/20 rounded-md border p-6">
        <h3 class="text-text text-xl">
          Café Mode <span class="text-text/60">| Daytime Hours</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="text-text/70 mt-2">
          Throughout the day, our space offers thoughtfully curated ambient
          soundscapes perfect for conversation, work, or quiet reflection.
          Quality sound becomes a subtle enhancement to daily island life.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-text/20 rounded-md border p-6">
        <h3 class="text-text text-xl">
          Community Curation <span class="text-text/60">| 4:00-6:30 PM</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="text-text/70 mt-2">
          Early evenings transform into platforms for local collectors and
          musical storytellers. Experience Salt Spring's diverse musical culture
          as community members share their collections and personal journeys
          through sound. Each curator brings their unique perspective, creating
          intimate connections between music and memory.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-text/20 rounded-md border p-6">
        <h3 class="text-text text-xl">
          Dark Mode <span class="text-text/60">| 7:00 PM - 12:00 AM</span>
        </h3>
        <p class="text-text/70 mt-2">
          As night falls, the space evolves into a sophisticated listening
          environment. Guest selectors and renowned DJs guide sonic journeys
          that balance deep listening with movement. This isn't loud, generic
          nightlife—it's an immersive, quality-focused musical experience
          featuring high-fidelity sound and carefully curated sets.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="border-text/20 rounded-md border p-6">
        <h3 class="text-text text-xl">
          Deep Listening Sessions <span class="text-text/60"
            >| Sundays, 1:30-3:00 PM</span
          >
        </h3>
        <p class="text-text/70 mt-2">
          Dedicated sessions where complete albums are experienced without
          interruption. In our age of shuffled playlists and fragmented
          attention, rediscover the meditative power of hearing a musical work
          in its entirety, surrounded by fellow listeners in shared
          contemplation.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <p>
      Limited capacity ensures an intimate experience. Stay tuned for ticketing
      information and updates.
    </p>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  main > :global(*) {
    grid-column: 2;
  }
</style>
